# Anything the image should build for itself, or that belongs to a developer's
# machine rather than to the image. Node modules in particular: they are
# platform specific, and copying a Windows install into a Linux image produces
# failures that look like code faults.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
.playwright-mcp
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
apps/api/var
var
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
